{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Christmas Mansion!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to Christmas Mansion, a cozy and festive holiday match-3 puzzle adventure where snow sparkles, gingerbread crunches, and every match brings the spirit of Christmas to life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Cozy Winter Match-3 Wonderland</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape into a world of twinkling lights, snowy rooftops, and festive melodies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Match candy canes, ornaments, stockings, stars, and gingerbread cookies in hundreds of levels. Every puzzle brings you closer to rebuilding and decorating the Winterland!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Perfect for relaxing by the fireplace anytime you need a cheerful break.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Swap, Match &amp; Make Holiday Magic</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use simple match-3 mechanics - swap, drag, and match - to create colorful combos and festive explosions! Blow away snow piles, melt icy tiles, and clear all obstacles as you progress through magical winter puzzles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Restore &amp; Decorate the Winter Lands</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swap pieces, beat levels and help Elf decorate the winter lands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An exciting adventure and quests wait for you. Build a cozy little cottage on the hill and a cookie factory, fire up the oven and get baking! Think you could whip up a nice batch of muffins? Build an ornament factory, ski workshop and complete dozens of other quests to prepare a fantastic holiday party. Winter has tons of fun in stock for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the Gingerbread decoration telling the tale of Hansel and Gretel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the scene first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/e0b27434ee9b200ee79de1f7542b97b8.poster.avif?t=1768576811\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/e0b27434ee9b200ee79de1f7542b97b8.webm?t=1768576811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/e0b27434ee9b200ee79de1f7542b97b8.mp4?t=1768576811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start building!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/107e5571882602d55a750b8ee95b2d3f.poster.avif?t=1768576811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/107e5571882602d55a750b8ee95b2d3f.webm?t=1768576811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the witch's castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/600dbeccb21bc8a4861c3dd089b5dc19.poster.avif?t=1768576811\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/600dbeccb21bc8a4861c3dd089b5dc19.webm?t=1768576811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/600dbeccb21bc8a4861c3dd089b5dc19.mp4?t=1768576811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast through the puzzles and have a fantastic Christmas holiday again! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/72f0c7d7a8b718efb85408742a8c525f.poster.avif?t=1768576811\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/72f0c7d7a8b718efb85408742a8c525f.webm?t=1768576811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/72f0c7d7a8b718efb85408742a8c525f.mp4?t=1768576811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Magical Features You\u2019ll Love</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Dozens of quests to complete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Powerful boosters and festive bonuses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Hundreds of joyful holiday match-3 levels with new obstacles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Cozy, cheerful visuals and relaxing seasonal music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Perfect Holiday Puzzle Adventure</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you love Christmas games, decoration adventures, or classic match-3 puzzles, Christmas Mansion brings all the winter cheer to your screen!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Warm cocoa energy + relaxing puzzles + festive decorating =<br>The ultimate Christmas escape!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Download Christmas Mansion today and let the holiday magic begin!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1824170?t=1768576811","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/59926410b8d10bb9592c344e9391c13f67e48b67/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768576811","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic