 hill and a cookie factory, fire up the oven and get baking! Think you could whip up a nice batch of muffins? Build an ornament factory, ski workshop and complete dozens of other quests to prepare a fantastic holiday party. Winter has tons of fun in stock for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create the Gingerbread decoration telling the tale of Hansel and Gretel!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clean the scene first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/e0b27434ee9b200ee79de1f7542b97b8.poster.avif?t=1768576811\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/e0b27434ee9b200ee79de1f7542b97b8.webm?t=1768576811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/e0b27434ee9b200ee79de1f7542b97b8.mp4?t=1768576811\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Start building!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/107e5571882602d55a750b8ee95b2d3f.poster.avif?t=1768576811\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/107e5571882602d55a750b8ee95b2d3f.webm?t=1768576811\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build the witch's castle!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1824170/extras/600dbeccb21bc8a4861c3dd089b5dc19.poster.avif?t=1768576811\" width=600 height=276 ><source src=\"ht